@startuml
title SD-S01 — Standard order technical states
caption To-Be · Order and Settlement · F03/F04 · TX-04–06
[*] --> AwaitingFee : merchant delivery
[*] --> AwaitingCash : Cash pickup
[*] --> PendingProof : direct transfer, hold recorded
AwaitingFee --> PendingProof : accept current fee + hold
AwaitingFee --> AwaitingFee : revised serviceable fee/time offer
AwaitingFee --> Rejected : no feasible offer or merchant declines
AwaitingCash --> Accepted : merchant accepts + reserves
AwaitingCash --> Rejected : merchant rejects
AwaitingFee --> Cancelled : eligible customer cancellation
AwaitingCash --> Cancelled : eligible customer cancellation
PendingProof --> PaymentReview : timely proof registered
PendingProof --> Expired : deadline reached without proof
PendingProof --> Cancelled : no transfer confirmed, unpaid and unaccepted
PendingProof --> PendingProof : sent or unsure, show WhatsApp follow-up
PaymentReview --> PaymentReview : customer cancellation denied, WhatsApp follow-up
PaymentReview --> Accepted : verified and feasible
PaymentReview --> Exception : mismatch or cannot fulfil
PaymentReview --> PaymentReview : reject evidence or issue 30-minute top-up notice
PaymentReview --> PaymentReview : timely top-up proof keeps the hold through review
PaymentReview --> Expired : top-up cutoff, no timely proof or remaining review
PaymentReview --> Rejected : merchant rejects order and releases unused hold
Accepted --> Preparing : allocation becomes used
Preparing --> Ready : record ready timestamp
Ready --> HandedOff : transfer order, record pickup or driver
Ready --> Ready : record driver arrival separately
Ready --> Exception : pre-handoff incident
Ready --> Completed : Cash pickup and receipt, same transaction
Ready --> NoShow : Cash pickup missed, no receipt
HandedOff --> Completed
HandedOff --> Exception : delivery incident
Accepted --> Cancelled : merchant inability creates full-refund obligation
Preparing --> Cancelled : merchant only, preserve used capacity
Ready --> Cancelled : merchant only, preserve used capacity
Exception --> Accepted : agreed reschedule, reallocate safely
Exception --> Cancelled : recorded reconciliation
@enduml
